 t('India\'s way forward','<b>Economic resilience</b>: reduce import dependence (electronics, pharma, rare earths); Atmanirbhar; ASEAN, EU, US; <b>Blue Dot Network, B3W</b>','<b>Military modernisation</b>: joint cyber/EW; air and naval strength; deep-strike specialised units','<b>Border infrastructure</b>: all-weather roads, tunnels, airfields','<b>Strategic partnerships</b> with US, Japan, Israel (AI, quantum, cyber)','<b>Maritime security</b> vs string of pearls; <b>connectivity</b>: India-Myanmar-Thailand Highway, BBIN','<b>Diplomacy</b>: CBMs, BRICS, SCO; <b>soft power</b>: ISA',w=26),
