 t('Recommendations','Widen <b>whole-of-government</b> approach; <b>Defence Export Promotion Agency (DEPA)</b> under PMO','Focus on <b>high-value platforms</b>: Tejas, BrahMos, Pinaka, Akash','Use export revenue for DPSU R&amp;D; <b>avoid autarkic</b> production',w=26),
